**NEHEMIAH CHAPTER 9**

The solemn fast and repentance of the people, Nehemiah 9:1,Nehemiah 9:2;

and the manner of it, Nehemiah 9:3.

The Levites confess and bless God for his goodness to them and their fathers, Nehemiah 9:4-8,

in Egypt, Nehemiah 9:9,Nehemiah 9:10;

in their journey out of it, Nehemiah 9:11,Nehemiah 9:12;

upon Mount Sinai, Nehemiah 9:13,Nehemiah 9:14;

in their journey towards Canaan, Nehemiah 9:15-18;

in the wilderness, Nehemiah 9:19-21; in driving out the nations before them, Nehemiah 9:22-26;

in hearing their prayer when in trouble, and saving them, Nehemiah 9:27-31.

They confess their sins, Nehemiah 9:32-37; and seal a covenant, Nehemiah 9:38.
